sequenceDiagram
    title GET /api/Users
    actor Admin as Admin
    participant UI as GetListUsersUI
    participant Endpoint as :UsersController
    participant Service as :UserService
    participant DB as :UnitOfWork
    participant Database as :Database

    Admin->>UI: 1.1 Yêu cầu hiển thị danh sách người dùng
    activate UI
    UI->>Endpoint: 2.1 GET /api/Users (pageNumber, pageSize)
    activate Endpoint

    Endpoint->>Service: 3.1 GetListUserAsync(pageNumber, pageSize)
    activate Service

    Service->>DB: 3.2 UserRepository.GetPagedAsync(pageNumber, pageSize, r => r.IsActive && !r.IsDeleted, includeProperties: "Role")
    activate DB
    DB->>Database: 3.3 Execute SELECT query with pagination
    activate Database
    Database-->>DB: 3.4 Paged list of Users
    deactivate Database
    deactivate DB

    Service-->>Endpoint: 3.5 PagedResponse of UserResponse
    deactivate Service
    Endpoint-->>UI: 3.6 200 OK (PagedResponse of UserResponse)
    deactivate Endpoint
    deactivate UI
